{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_118_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "aaa1bb56b1ada86bf12b725cd7e4dd1d3bcf2a630dd05462ef6c5c9a58ec5e3b", "ja": "うっうー！　お仕事に復帰できたお祝いの……\nハイ、ターッチ！", "zh": "呜呜——！为庆祝能回到工作岗位……来，击掌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
